# {{ .Service.Name }}

Scheduled **data pipeline** (CronJob) scaffolded by `infragenie generate` from the
Golden Path **{{ .GoldenPath.Name }}**. Conformant by construction — `infragenie
review` reports zero Golden Path findings.

The CronJob ships non-root, read-only rootfs, resource limits, `Forbid`
concurrency, and bounded job history.

## Layout

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `cronjob.yaml` | CronJob (hourly by default) running the pipeline container |
| `Dockerfile` | Multi-stage, distroless, non-root |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | CI workflow covering the Golden Path's required steps |

